    "updated_at": "2018-02-07T20:03:52Z",
    "body": "Thank you all so much for working on this.\r\n\r\nWhen I built https://github.com/cloudflare-apps/smart-underline, I ran into this issue and ultimately went with [reading pixel data from a canvas after drawing an “I” and “g”](https://github.com/cloudflare-apps/smart-underline/blob/8574013b3f8942054ca91cc0d8b521537c05419d/coffee/smart-underline.coffee#L72-L74) to work around it.\r\n\r\nAlong the way, I built this test suite of sorts:\r\nhttps://cdn.rawgit.com/adamschwartz/typography.js/master/index.html\r\n\r\nI hope it can be helpful in some way with the work being done here. 😄 ",
